      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OFF THE CHART (5) is generally an honest type in the frame at seven of 33 starts but missed the placings last time when fifth (29.99) over 515m at Sandown. Form at the trip excellent including 13 wins. Rates highly here and will go close. ZIPPING RUGER (4) turned in a solid run last start over 525m at Taree Super Track finishing 4th and beaten only 2 lengths (29.92). Scored previously at this trip. Got the money at his only try from this box. Great chance to atone. RONALDO VELLA (2) has a strong record here with two wins and two placings from five starts. In the money last time at this track (22.85) in a Grade 5, finishing a 4.5 lengths second. Among the main chances. QUEEN ERA (1) comes off a (22.61) win last time, scoring by 3 lengths in a Free For All over 401m at Richmond. Has already won six times from this draw.",
